  "summary": "MLE-STAR-Open is an unofficial, Google-free reimplementation of the MLE-STAR multi-agent ML engineering pipeline using OpenAI-compatible APIs (OpenRouter) and DuckDuckGo search, operated via CLI runner scripts with .env/environment-variable configuration. The Ollama local-model adapter is explicitly deferred, and the project targets local experimentation rather than official MLE-Bench scale.",
